PPC_AUDIO_CS4231A|QEMU hardware|ppc|choice|auto|auto,y,n|Crystal CS4231A (ISA)
I386_AUDIO_PCSPK|QEMU hardware|i386|choice|auto|auto,y,n|PC speaker
PPC_AUDIO_PCSPK|QEMU hardware|ppc|choice|auto|auto,y,n|PC speaker
